{
  "game": "Black Myth: Wukong",
  "process": "b1-Win64-Shipping",
  "source": "mopic",
  "max_width": 1280,
  "notes": "Wukong-save with its play steps run twice in one session (PSO check, 2026-11-01): the first pass is measured as \"first\", the same keys again right after it as \"again\". Read with the pso / pso_us columns of perf-frames.csv. Route and save handling as in Wukong-save.json. Both passes take about 2 x (4 x play_s + 50) s, more than the harness's default 900 s window for a recipe: run it with -Seconds 1500 (play_s 90), or the harness stops the pilot in the second pass (MENU_FAIL, 2026-11-01).",
  "config": {
    "FrameworkConfig_RememberMenuState": "true",
    "FrameworkConfig_MenuOpen": "false"
  },
  "save_slot": {
    "dir": "{gamedir}\\b1\\Saved\\SaveGames\\{sid64}",
    "file": "ArchiveSaveFile.9.sav"
  },
  "vars": {
    "play_s": 45,
    "load_wait_s": 10
  },
  "checkpoints": {
